  "question": {
    "text": "A sample consisting of Hydrogen atoms in the ground state is excited by monochromatic radiation of energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. If we were to observe the emission spectrum of this sample, then the number of spectral lines observed, will be",
